  "label": "Conspiracy Theory Flag (Green with Question Mark Man)",
  "description": "This flag is a symbol associated with various conspiracy theories, particularly those involving anti-government, anti-establishment, and anti-Christian or anti-Masonic sentiments. The emblem of a man in a suit with a question mark on his face surrounded by laurel wreaths is a common motif in extremist circles. Understanding this flag requires knowledge of its symbolic meaning in conspiracy culture.",
